    "volume": 120
  },
  
  {
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": [ "mon_exalted_convert" ],
    "sound": "\"There is a single, glorious truth, etched in the hearts of the faithful. Join in unity, or be washed away.\"",
    "volume": 120
  },
  
  {
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": [ "mon_exalted_convert" ],
    "sound": "\"May our blessings sever the tongues of the forsaken.\"",
    "volume": 120
  },
  
  {
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": [ "mon_exalted_convert" ],
    "sound": "\"I am no sleeper agent. I am a liberator. It is you who are asleep.\"",
    "volume": 120
  },
  
  {
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": [ "mon_exalted_convert" ],
    "sound": "\"Skin is the prison of the blessed and the stronghold of the heretic.\"",
    "volume": 120
  },
  
  {
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": [ "mon_exalted_convert" ],
    "sound": "\"Rid them of their unfaithful organs. Bring new hearts to the unbelievers.\"",
    "volume": 120
  },
  
  {
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": [ "mon_exalted_convert" ],
    "sound": "\"Even the unbreakable can be reshaped.\"",
    "volume": 120
  },
  
  {
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": [ "mon_exalted_convert" ],
    "sound": "\"We need not be swift. We are inexorable.\"",
    "volume": 120
  },
  
  {
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": [ "mon_exalted_convert" ],
    "sound": "\"There is no hate behind our blades. We kill out of love, and the desire to share Perfection's blessings with all.\"",
    "volume": 120
  },
  
  {
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": [ "mon_exalted_convert" ],
    "sound": "\"Only through sacred infection can a vessel become pure.\"",
    "volume": 120
  },
  
  {
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": [ "mon_exalted_convert" ],
    "sound": "\"Flesh is a betrayal of the self.\"",
    "volume": 120
  },
  
  {
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": [ "mon_exalted_convert" ],
    "sound": "\"Witness the glory of true, unwavering unity.\"",
    "volume": 120
  },
  
  {
    "type": "speech",
